{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JER",
  "chapter": 10,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JER.10.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear ye the word which the LORD speaketh to you, O house of Israel:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the LORD, Learn not the way of the heathen, and be not dismayed at the signs of heaven; for the heathen are dismayed at them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the customs of the people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " vain: for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cutteth a tree out of the forest, the work of the hands of the workman, with the ax.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They deck it with silver and with gold; they fasten it with nails and with hammers, that it may not move.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upright as the palm tree, but speak not: they must needs be borne, because they cannot go. Be not afraid of them; for they cannot do evil, neither also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in them to do good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Forasmuch as ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none like to thee, O LORD; thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " great, and thy name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " great in might.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who would not fear thee, O King of nations? for to thee doth it appertain: forasmuch as among all the wise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the nations, and in all their kingdoms, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none like to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But they are altogether brutish and foolish: the stock ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a doctrine of vanities.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Silver spread into plates is brought from Tarshish, and gold from Uphaz, the work of the workman, and of the hands of the founder: blue and purple ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their clothing: they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all the work of skillful ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the true God, he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the living God, and an everlasting king: at his wrath the earth shall tremble, and the nations shall not be able to abide his indignation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus shall ye say to them, The gods that have not made the heavens and the earth, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they shall perish from the earth, and from under these heavens.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath made the earth by his power, he hath established the world by his wisdom, and hath stretched out the heavens by his discretion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When he uttereth his voice, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a multitude of waters in the heavens, and he causeth the vapors to ascend from the ends of the earth; he maketh lightnings with rain, and bringeth forth the wind out of his treasures.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every man is brutish in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knowledge: every founder is confounded by the graven image: for his molten image ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " falsehood, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no breath in them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " vanity, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the work of errors: in the time of their visitation they shall perish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The portion of Jacob ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not like them: for he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the former of all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; and Israel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the rod of his inheritance: The LORD of hosts ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his name.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Gather up thy wares out of the land, O inhabitant of the fortress.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the LORD; Behold, I will sling out the inhabitants of the land at this once, and will distress them that they may find ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Woe is me for my hurt! my wound is grievous: but I said, Truly this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a grief, and I must bear it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My tabernacle is laid waste, and all my cords are broken: my children are gone from me, and they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none to stretch forth my tent any more, and to set up my curtains.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the pastors have become brutish, and have not sought the LORD: therefore they shall not prosper, and all their flocks shall be scattered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, the sound of the noise is come, and a great commotion from the north country, to make the cities of Judah desolate, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a den of dragons.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O LORD, I know that the way of man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not in himself: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not in man that walketh to direct his steps.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O LORD, correct me, but with judgment; not in thy anger, lest thou bring me to nothing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JER.10.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JER.10.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Pour out thy fury upon the heathen that know thee not, and upon the families that call not on thy name: for they have eaten up Jacob, and devoured him, and consumed him, and have made his habitation desolate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
